2026-10-27 15:08:15 | DEBUG    | sse_starlette.sse | chunk: b'event: message\r\ndata: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":5,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\\n  \\"content\\": \\"# 2. Student Responsibilities  \\\\nStudents are responsible for maintaining accurate enrollment information, meeting academic deadlines, attending required learning activities, and complying with published examination procedures.  \\\\n- Maintain an active student account and keep contact details current.  \\\\n- Read official notices and course communications within a reasonable period.  \\\\n- Submit work through the designated academic system before stated deadlines.  \\\\n- Respect the learning environment, staff, visitors, and other students.  \\\\n- Protect passwords, access cards, and other credentials assigned to the student.  \\\\n- Report suspected safety incidents or serious policy violations through the appropriate channel.  \\\\nStudents should seek clarification early when a rule or deadline is unclear. Requests for exceptions should be supported by relevant evidence and submitted through the prescribed process.\\",\\n  \\"metadata\\": {\\n    \\"source\\": \\"01_student_handbook (1) (1).pdf\\",\\n    \\"section_path\\": [\\n      \\"NORTHBRIDGE INSTITUTE OF TECHNOLOGY\\",\\n      \\"2. Student Responsibilities\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\"page_numbers\\": [\\n      3\\n    ],\\n    \\"element_ids\\": [\\n      23,\\n      24,\\n      25,\\n      26,\\n      27,\\n      28,\\n      29,\\n      30,\\n      31\\n    ],\\n    \\"content_types\\": [\\n      \\"heading\\",\\n      \\"paragraph\\",\\n      \\"list_item\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\"headers\\": {\\n      \\"Header 1\\": \\"2. Student Responsibilities\\"\\n    },\\n    \\"chunk_id\\": \\"01_student_handbook (1) (1)_chunk_5\\",\\n    \\"document_name\\": \\"01_student_handbook (1) (1).pdf\\"\\n  }\\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\\n  \\"content\\": \\"# 2. Student Responsibilities  \\\\nStudents are responsible for maintaining accurate e